abstract: "Exact area-weighted zonal statistics of two harmonized night-time light series (1992-2024 DMSP-scale digital numbers; 1992-2025 VIIRS-scale radiance) for every PBS Census 2023 tehsil and district, a panel merged with the crosswalked census populations 1951-2023, and district rankings by light under three exclusion rules. Built for Professor M. Yasir Khan (University of Pittsburgh)."
